{"title":"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/5/a75a8f8d6c3dde5d74d6e8b47d2a751070463156.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\neq 0, \\frac x{2} = y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"109\" height=\"34\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/b/c8b67a5bd340f2ae896a18d3ef9e44d73a0b9ec2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{4} = 4y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"56\" height=\"33\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/e/faeb44a1c0d6bd24101ecd1b6dc225b3bc21d1ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 8\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 16\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 32\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 64\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 128$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/b/c8b67a5bd340f2ae896a18d3ef9e44d73a0b9ec2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{4} = 4y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"56\" height=\"33\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/1/2e16780fb35db53fa132f1ba40da4acd608bb174.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=16y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" />. Plugging in the other equation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/e/81e746ada0a919d0227c84099053dcec737e3f01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{16y}{2} = y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"71\" height=\"37\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/1/321ea455e2980e60ccbcd09a20f52c29f612061e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2-8y=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" />. Factoring, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/d/c8d58cebcd044e13a4f6782aa4393c351b4962cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y(y-8)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" />, so the solutions are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d79c96e270e148516fb5dd4a73725d8be87c80c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"18\" />, we also have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/8/5c8eb2cb0cf3c53328e172b4cf6f48f09f2f8e9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/4/8a4808fab877e290bdc0e68ce61cc8a852fd397b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />. Hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/2/1524a7a40c71cb5d087bd7adb0e9153c8b644fd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=16\\cdot 8 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 128}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"171\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME\" title=\"1983 AHSME\">1983 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1983 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1983\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1983 AHSME P